  "passage": "Welcome to the Greenfield Football Club webpage! We are a lively group that meets regularly every Tuesday and Thursday from 3:30 PM to 5:00 PM in the school sports field. Our club is perfect for anyone who enjoys football and wants to play in a team. To join, you must obtain permission from your parents and submit a signed form at the entrance of the sports hall. We have a large collection of footballs, jerseys, and other equipment available for all members. Our coach, Mr. Jones, is very good-looking and friendly, but his training drills can sometimes be confusing for beginners. However, we always support each other. We focus on regular practice sessions to improve skills like passing and shooting. Throughout the year, we play friendly matches and enter local tournaments. If you have any questions, feel free to ask any club member. We hope to see you soon!",
